{"job_id":"F-b179f59fd1c066b00712","family_id":"F-b179f59fd1c066b00712","title":"한국과학기술원 학사규정","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":12,"target_id":"fa0f64782aa229e36c70e81916be269ff923f54d3348488a727b6f2010f6367e","source_hash":"36df735d756da5f538314c47281c80f58fea0b6ff53ce7762f6abced67da9dbd","text":"KAIST 学术规章"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":139,"target_id":"49e0bab3b60afeeb25d41b23c961b095b0b3364db0015b538016139f0bb9b08d","source_hash":"f9d239c6dac3c9266c54d8015d19ca387221042fa86088f40c2b77b24f0769e5","text":"第一条（目的）本法令的目的是根据《韩国科学技术院法》第十四条，规定韩国科学技术院（KAIST）设立的博士、专业硕士和硕士学位课程以及学士学位课程的教学活动所必需的事项。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":139,"end":503,"target_id":"f589154cd34f6ac344db4581aa9cbd6c5ef959cb4eb75016e927c6c427570d96","source_hash":"60399064f83ed7164f5ce1ebbcab38696555cc6fca1a03d377a73d2591ae4ced","text":"第二条（定义）本法令中使用的术语含义如下。\n1.“研究经验”是指在四年制或以上教育机构，或在韩国科学技术院（以下简称“院”）院长（以下简称“院长”）认可的研究机构，从事拟任专业领域或与其密切相关的领域研究的年数。\n2.“教育培训经验”是指在教育机构从事教育培训四年或四年以上，培训内容可以是拟任专业领域，也可以是与其密切相关的领域。\n3.“实践经验培训”是指在政府、根据《公共机构运作法》第4条设立的公共机构或总统认可的机构进行的培训，培训内容为即将被任命的专业领域或与其密切相关的领域。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":503,"end":675,"target_id":"a35f63b463cadd681ea04b78b3f0080032c9b09f2e4654d27387858ec85fffc1","source_hash":"96e0bf876c8edce83d7d7a3d66fd81f0f379bbffbbff17e9f97bbd6a809f1115","text":"第三条（大学名称等）\n① 根据《韩国高等科学技术院法》（以下简称“该法”）第十四条第三款的规定，该大学的名称为科学技术大学（以下简称“该大学”）。\n② 大学应设院长，院长由校长任命。\n③院长奉校长之命，负责大学的学术事务，指导和监督附属人员，并指导学生。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":675,"end":725,"target_id":"24fe6ae20ae9a6471ec4becf0c8d8c3bfad6ce0e0314fc2a4a11572998fc54d2","source_hash":"1e11be4069a23f54b76bb029c603c03bd859020551e73cae3cede3ab99f4a3b2","text":"第3-2条（组织）有关科学技术研究所的组织，包括大学的组织，由校长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":725,"end":771,"target_id":"f6a9a9a0a9f75902ee968ba0385dcc32e0d24579eafb18b320981430773fdc0c","source_hash":"5a5870a627d7ba9707d007706a0eee3ac02a86d6a040b27e6ecb96f748e7163e","text":"第四条（教职人员分类）根据本法第十五条规定，教职人员分为全职和非全职职位。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":771,"end":1082,"target_id":"84d0b2e649fe12b78827e73028548d603e9738da4dc04bcd58f7a6d93e5bec9b","source_hash":"9bbaaaf7f857d59d6ecda4eb5c87d1db477f48100e4cf1dc13db9986a8cba246","text":"第五条（教师资格标准）\n① 科学技术院系和大学的教职人员必须是韩国国民或具有科研领导才能、教育能力、教育洞察力和品格的外国人，并且必须符合下列各款规定的要求。\n1. 助理教授：已获得博士学位的人员\n2. 副教授：获得博士学位后至少拥有3年研究或教学经验的人员\n3. 教授：获得博士学位后拥有7年或以上研究或教学经验的人员\n② 第1款各分项规定的研究经验年限和教学经验年限可以合并计算。\n③ 关于教师的事宜，应按照韩国科学技术院的校规（以下简称“校规”）确定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1082,"end":1426,"target_id":"b9285c55938ae5e18ff4dd0eabcaddddd53b9b2007fdcfc2183197880e869e3f","source_hash":"81f8e37d2a47c62d0e0663d08a14eba0ff188f4aab0a5482cb0daafc1ed440b5","text":"第六条（特聘、特晋升）\n① 尽管有第五条第一款的规定，但校长可以特别任命或者特别提拔在教职人员的聘任和晋升中取得杰出研究成果的人，但须经董事会决议。\n② 尽管有第5条的规定，但如有必要填补难以聘用博士学位持有者或特别需要实践经验的院系的教职空缺，校长可经董事会决议，特别聘用四年制大学毕业生或具有同等或更高学历，且在研究、教学或实践经验方面具有五年以上综合经验的人员担任助理教授；聘用具有八年以上综合经验的人员担任副教授；聘用具有十二年以上综合经验的人员担任教授。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1426,"end":1509,"target_id":"f7b2a19919c015d472e4912c64c979b097b8fc71418ee1ef5a041de03fb2f703","source_hash":"580c80e67ffb96e0e89e8b43cafc30a0032032bf84a0cbb52f1ca447183380f3","text":"第七条（退休）\n① 必须对全职教师实行终身教职制度。\n② 退休制度实施的具体事宜，由董事会决议后，通过学校规章予以确定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1509,"end":1595,"target_id":"0ea5c0541f0fe0258d00278d2d3b3d7ba7ce447c07f144e504fd2facc1c0986a","source_hash":"72fd26309e784e1ea77889f5a1093468cb1e7635058ed374153a8d2b5f214425","text":"第八条（荣誉教授）根据第七条规定达到强制退休年龄退休的人员中，有杰出成就、品德高尚、对韩国科学技术院发展做出贡献的人员，可以被任命为荣誉教授。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1595,"end":1710,"target_id":"10b666a3cf1ddc7f2edd770c27931513db770401b0926624ad04901afd81ba7b","source_hash":"a39f227e455d489ea2531093f2026e407282ab94c927a0d8c03f191d79c6e23d","text":"第九条（资格考试和绩效评估）\n① 校长审核教职员工的资格并评估其成就。\n② 根据第1款规定进行考核和评估的标准，由校长在有关教职员工人事事项的委员会审议后确定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1710,"end":1809,"target_id":"08b60f31b32237c570c0689c25c625aabb0f3f7fe7bc6d92dd05d7fa5c9c7781","source_hash":"baecc27403e596d942477e0a2ee8fbc96c90b68b5d80733c85efaccbac4b0b57","text":"第十条（上课天数和学期数）韩国科学技术院的年度上课天数至少为32周，学年原则上采用两学期制；但如有必要，可采用两学期或两学期以上的多学期制。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1809,"end":1891,"target_id":"d0e916d5dafa406c96788cbb6688d526b6dc9feccbac75dd866b4f46388e40bc","source_hash":"85e663251e4a391d5317db91688224631021caccf8a15d0d7a02532d7105ce60","text":"第十一节（学分、完成方式、学习期限、注册期限等）各科目的学分以学分计算，各课程的完成方式、学习期限和注册期限由学校规定确定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1891,"end":1965,"target_id":"d1168420b3684d24c337b94c8cf6c4e7ffcf9872e258bc11e161629889b6f8f7","source_hash":"41cb177c212d7bab002e68b82cd11624a05204a6b99d77d5803927f505a36cdd","text":"第十二条（系、专业和课程）韩国科学技术院各专业的系、专业和课程，应根据科学技术的发展状况，由学校规章予以确定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1965,"end":2077,"target_id":"2812669b8dd95941a4268102713b8fd418159e7e9e7c76d703062e2b51dfae47","source_hash":"8292e85fae5a04a25dff1b99dd054013a9b364e4111c2f5b82cd6ae0ee77a29d","text":"第十三条（学位授予）\n① 在韩国科学技术院完成规定的课程并通过必要的考试后，可获得博士学位、专业硕士学位、硕士学位或学士学位。\n② 根据第1款授予学位的必要事项，由学校规章确定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2077,"end":2100,"target_id":"454740b74066e0832085292b356456571ddb926722ad2597640e356fd69307cc","source_hash":"06150e12ff50a658e247cc25029fe12ba39a43d6e1ed72fc529fe0f208cbefab","text":"删除第 13-2 条 <2001.7.30>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2100,"end":2191,"target_id":"fc4ccb34d31512af5a2395264a70606d4fa4c0af04e7bc82440bf3fa42675235","source_hash":"328a85590a941ca4b0be5a866a6cdbe8c476e51a25a1739a8c8d92eab5ec0ad2","text":"第十三条之三（专业硕士学位类型）根据本法第十四条第四款授予的专业硕士学位类型，按照高等教育法实施令第四十三条第二款的规定执行。在此，“硕士”应视为“专业硕士学位”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00018","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2191,"end":2285,"target_id":"048215dc5ece18995984827cb6ce025b75373afde4de8f60c2e703811500f4ae","source_hash":"959d7d75897febf37a09e97cd1a0cf0f16aaf48e2ad6a513e4774ad3c5d3089f","text":"第十四条（学生招生名额）韩国科学技术院的学生招生名额，应根据对科学家和技术人员的预测需求以及该院的招生能力进行调整，各课程、系和专业的学生招生名额，应由学校规章确定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00019","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2285,"end":2525,"target_id":"9d1a36ca291c6cbd6db8072e5ba19779ddd332ea4b8c54384e870d76892404a1","source_hash":"fb220dbc64cb16f9f17261a66c7faa61b0a14d94fd92fc367ee732de27f63977","text":"第十五条（人员配额报告）\n① 总统应制定招生人数计划，并在入学考试前向科学技术部长和教育部长报告。<2013年3月23日；2014年11月19日；2017年7月26日；2025年10月1日修订>\n② 总统应在入学报名截止日期后30日内，将已报名入学人员名单报告给科学与信息通信技术部长和教育部长。<2013年3月23日、2014年11月19日、2017年7月26日、2025年10月1日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00020","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2525,"end":3360,"target_id":"501ba435479e6f05c10b7aebe704d81d6488ba6fd841c5989e23fdef8e0b008e","source_hash":"78b98174b058279d7487b3e8e444a7e9baa321dd31a5a323446222e34ec45604","text":"第十六条（入学资格）\n① 有资格进入大学的人必须符合下列任一条件。<2013年3月23日修订，2024年1月9日再次修订>\n1. 高中毕业生或经教育部长认可具有同等或更高教育水平的人员\n2. 在外国完成相当于《初等和中等教育法》第二条第三款规定的高中教育课程的人\n3. 符合下列任何一项条件，并经科学天才评选委员会认定在科学技术领域具有杰出能力的人员\nA. 预计完成高二学业的\nb. 目前就读于根据《促进资优教育法》第六条第一款指定或设立的资优学校的学生\n这是根据《天才教育促进法》第十六条第二款选出的特殊天才教育受益人。\n② 符合韩国科学技术院硕士或专业硕士课程入学资格者，须符合下列任一条件。<2013年3月23日修订>\n1. 四年制大学毕业生，持有或预期持有学士或以上学位\n2. 国外四年制大学的毕业生或准毕业生\n3. 经教育部长认可，其学术水平等于或高于第1款所述资格的人士\n③ 有资格进入韩国科学技术院攻读博士学位的人必须符合下列其中一项条件。\n1. 持有或拟持有硕士或以上学位者\n2. 已完成国外大学认可的、至少相当于硕士学位的课程的人员\n3. 在高等科学技术学院攻读硕士学位或专业硕士学位，并因其优异的学术表现而获得学术事务和研究审查委员会认可的学生。\n4. 第1款第3项所指科学天才选拔委员会的组成、运作等事宜，由科学及信息通信技术部条例规定。<2013年3月23日、2017年7月26日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00021","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3360,"end":3417,"target_id":"309642d2e8d5b5ec891424c0980c91ce503b00c760df213f1739dfa8a9d38077","source_hash":"45f954e667a68c2dc8856a1031c312fa04559de0eb985f559215e787e2e6d334","text":"第十七条（录取方式）有关大学入学考试的录取方式，例如考试时间、科目和评分标准等事项，由学校规定确定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00022","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3417,"end":3552,"target_id":"d7cc4f3f5722b441bcdd5f294baf7a2cdf6bffeb53cb6eb8c6e9e00517128d00","source_hash":"1259a4c823e04fc35d7ea6ac56a95772cf4565b234330f814bd4b8cac5da4a99","text":"第十八条（外国学生）总统可以授予在韩国或国外高中、大学或研究生院毕业的外国公民入学资格，但仅限于符合第十六条规定条件的外国公民。总统可以对学校类型、学习期限等进行调查，并由学术事务和研究审查委员会进行审议。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00023","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3552,"end":3631,"target_id":"b02f1b3ae67cc2b917938d158542054835b0500f697b82220d4344d9770ae3e2","source_hash":"2832a3af8c3516a59216b637ac32ac18e18e88e7b30c40a398b50a762c0e113d","text":"第十九条（减少教育费用和支付奖学金）韩国科学技术院各专业的学生，​​其教育费用（如学费）可以减少或免除，或者可以获得奖学金。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00024","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3631,"end":3669,"target_id":"2a6d76f45d999424d1a37b1e314ee5c800a558dd939afc3f2aa897db5efdaafe","source_hash":"2783196ecbf74a31fbbf1561fbd1acbfc02a0ee41981e8243562e40d32c9d26e","text":"第20条（授权规定）执行本法令所需事项由学校规章决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00025","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3669,"end":3714,"target_id":"12cac7d4e8bde41145fdc37d5212505d38dae13f6a14ee4d6f9d2097065b6301","source_hash":"78a4155a0606caac3b9376b29238e0d49c487430d040a8d0bc2617eba5aae775","text":"补充规定 <第5926号，1971年12月31日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00026","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3714,"end":3757,"target_id":"3faccf54437acc7212bc55fab5c00540148649d932c1cf6529fbaf4da4ddf61d","source_hash":"d3d46a4853101dbbfee422293e1a53fcfdd3b7372fe595a333417150d36d65f3","text":"补充规定 <第9279号，1979年1月6日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00027","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3757,"end":4072,"target_id":"f805a7eab85e234dc50bffb5f7a67a8e73d7e739566de41a8073b9746d7b0e5b","source_hash":"c36a4b006edd1a990bc4d63d66ab2fe8798181e6ecc6a0dfcbfe4830ff5bf29e","text":"补充条款（韩国科学技术院法实施令）<第10144号，1981年1月5日>\n\n①（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n② 和③ 省略\n\n④（其他法律的修订）韩国科学院学士学位条例修订如下。\n\n标题“韩国科学院学士学位条例”应改为“韩国高等科学技术院学士学位条例”；第1条中，“韩国科学院法实施令（以下简称“法令”）第20条”应改为“韩国高等科学技术院法实施令（以下简称“法令”）第17条”，“韩国科学院（以下简称“科学院”）”应改为“韩国高等科学技术院（以下简称“院”）”；删除第3条；第4条中，“该法第12条”应改为“该法第15条”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00028","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4072,"end":4170,"target_id":"febd99b009dca888796b0a347790247c58f60f7f11556d4436a11f8c1a166ae1","source_hash":"708e48018a9376ac59e45c91b6dd419cfe58e57746caaec5e44432bb1c470019","text":"补充规定 <1985年6月11日第11704号>\n\n①（生效日期）本法令自1985年6月15日起生效。\n\n②（修改其他法律）对《韩国科学技术院法》实施细则修改如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00029","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4170,"end":4249,"target_id":"c5d792b5ba3214e97784574eb27489475e365e82616bc681d1fd3ab4314574f8","source_hash":"79c1e29318202cc54e7ca39a10e54d32c515af3a43ec37d0c9c5d7d597396ecd","text":"第17条至第20条被删除。\n\n③（该法的生效日期）第3778号法律，即《韩国科学技术院法修正案》，将于1985年6月15日生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00030","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4249,"end":4493,"target_id":"cf4f54333efd01822e64229432eb2d0c22b0912247215759d21d3cbc75a51b67","source_hash":"2d73a56a26b4b386ae223ab879fcce39410d2bcff10f3be7663dc9d6d40b0935","text":"补充规定 <1989年7月4日第12749号>\n\n①（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。但是，第十条的修正规定自1990年3月1日起生效。\n\n②（废止法案）韩国科学技术院科学组织史运作条例予以废止。\n\n③（关于韩国科学技术院学生身份的过渡措施）在本法令生效时，在韩国科学技术院就读的学生，应视为根据本法令就读于科学技术大学的学生。\n\n4（修改其他法令）《教育法》实施令修改如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00031","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4493,"end":4582,"target_id":"badf54ffd060d9feb371d43d21530a7e360afce2f57045282ea7cb267b9848a3","source_hash":"a1a8180fde02761cacabd46f5416a0958ba13c2dfb973ea8fc7f729853a611ec","text":"第 81 条第 1 款第 4 项规定如下。\n\n  4. 符合韩国科学技术院（KAIST）学士学位条例第十六条第一款第三项规定，并通过科学技术学院入学考试并注册的人员。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00032","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4582,"end":4618,"target_id":"b0a756e694ffea6ba46e8db50a995c730ed46c17810c0e02ae4bf450482cb53c","source_hash":"f5daf57ca06ddc65c5b4c552e24703ac183ccea2cdb1b292eef52271e06e967a","text":"增编（教育部及其附属机构的组织结构）<1991年2月1日第13282号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00033","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4618,"end":4648,"target_id":"9aee6874faca5d02b89d4fca200e60d7cf4241a52ee9d681a9d94152a0a36170","source_hash":"40ac608cf2787f4f50a97c8b940ad8db5f2f59c445aea0216bf6cbd54d933b82","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00034","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4648,"end":4668,"target_id":"32edb509ff50a6eca4a636e464e67cebe2a2fb3d8b483df7b7c1ac03802d926d","source_hash":"f50f92d8a1ce421c7e27210816aec473d728d3f33bdcf587fc0fc86f440ed69c","text":"第二条（废除其他法律）已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00035","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4668,"end":4682,"target_id":"cb6bdaec993bc2acf777c9161f4bf97d425b994ecd9b316c0d19bbd08ed8173b","source_hash":"c2fbcde7f1d258e0c33a99f26f67b3facb905350c6f3a4a92cd04d5157770cef","text":"省略第3条和第4条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00036","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4682,"end":4743,"target_id":"e24be453a72c869f2f66a42280f43f036a273d5d7e704730f53bafd335c7f395","source_hash":"3927cf5b3a795a694fb7f15657134df4247a124bb24478f45862a8a4753278ae","text":"第五条（修改其他法律）①至<78> 已省略\n\n  <79> 韩国科学技术院学士学位条例修订如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00037","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4743,"end":4810,"target_id":"b6d48195c7653f122872388c9a9e653bb699060bee8ed94c66143d0ea2a53282","source_hash":"d56347da5961aeb3c6ae3b51985a60ea15d432cba8ecadd88b413c8bdb82b1c7","text":"  第十五条和第十六条第一款和第二款中的“教育部长”应改为“教育部长”。\n\n  <80> 至 <148> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00038","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4810,"end":4842,"target_id":"210f2ecfb22b8fc918b7db6a72d67e2aae1af5793bbc2b0da9f1d435019542b4","source_hash":"a72458317ec2d814a7e1b667e18a5ba2740a6f3ddd6ba3620dc7cbb782091d76","text":"补充法令（教育法实施令）<第13893号，1993年5月26日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00039","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4842,"end":4872,"target_id":"efbd616a6d7d668309aa7495f88bb0102de88147257441929045fcf12d38ec0f","source_hash":"40ac608cf2787f4f50a97c8b940ad8db5f2f59c445aea0216bf6cbd54d933b82","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00040","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4872,"end":4880,"target_id":"033f9bd16b6047797b9a05cf6e00041216be882e7ecc0d8e3efb736dddce0fa8","source_hash":"1fa2d78222cc5f3a7b268ba3015a524a8e57a9355a8b17e0ae4253566ef34323","text":"第 2 条已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00041","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4880,"end":4972,"target_id":"7d62ad3f4c1b3ccb162bb73ee0d3bb810a527122ed95262e8bf50cd6494a72ae","source_hash":"f8dd0fe6177eb4d313b3fee6afe43d1ba875b424e4ce6b19f67d1f13bf84637d","text":"第三条（修改其他法律）① 省略\n\n  ② 韩国科学技术院学士学位条例修改如下。\n\n  第十七条第一款中的“大学入学考试”应改为“大学学业能力考试”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00042","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4972,"end":5013,"target_id":"6a9326d174690c99a4aea24cfe35c3c4b6f64671e90636b7c61589b3e2e01365","source_hash":"302418fea95deb0ebaa3264580fec4705b5003ca951fa815140995e39acb1b04","text":"增编（教育部及人力资源部及其附属机构的组织结构）<第17115号，2001年1月29日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00043","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5013,"end":5043,"target_id":"f9626a1781299c22e2e40c1da5bb62d6e3e74f6e01df292f1de088d54ee61c08","source_hash":"40ac608cf2787f4f50a97c8b940ad8db5f2f59c445aea0216bf6cbd54d933b82","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00044","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5043,"end":5058,"target_id":"c0c1bd243254640f84a09b05fe5c31aa111f69a9435da8d80f19f2d9f6d4d71f","source_hash":"119c19aa8cf5d20a95854f948299b43b564b2b8788981249c71d35dec8490177","text":"省略第2至4条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00045","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5058,"end":5207,"target_id":"107ac7eb03af29d115f6b2053800f2ea3a3e0fb2e0fced4230e2c15a920a3ad0","source_hash":"55038a1f68103f5de3613be328352f8de2f5ad75f86504000f25b6b8ad164dd8","text":"第五条（修改其他法律）①至<116> 已省略\n\n  <117> 韩国科学技术院学士学位条例修订如下。\n\n  第十五条第一款和第二款，以及第十六条第一款第一项和第二款第三项中，“教育部长”应改为“教育和人力资源部长”。 \n\n  <118> 至 <152> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00046","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5207,"end":5251,"target_id":"68020da43e28665dd69c0ee0570045e81d98a44434fe032e5670e9c47a1e6b64","source_hash":"b613d76880791ec205da81910dec579b584340ef7773459619656894c36c6bb3","text":"补充规定 <第17322号，2001年7月30日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00047","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5251,"end":5295,"target_id":"8d472da9a1b79357d887777c08a2e5c602b0dd7a9551bb1bf9d2fb88e8a53eca","source_hash":"31fd88fa4887c3451c87f082f59171ce583c5715f4ad87f916fe0e5dfe9655c9","text":"增编（教育部、科学技术部及其附属机构的组织结构）<20740号，2008年2月29日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00048","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5295,"end":5324,"target_id":"16a594065677ae899fedd7573a3b38e303858e099bf839b4c63479bcf7eae436","source_hash":"7e5f07ffff6aef2f2136019cfb5263979ba5a34dacd8394c05b2d3c719360d57","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00049","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5324,"end":5341,"target_id":"098190f8b21b5e5e434e41d49d27fc49682bd710556b74e50b0876590d9863f2","source_hash":"bc6c318c350b2ff1aac4a31f65fcae9d049d5f2d9358ead70ed1a2e0bc93798c","text":"省略第2至6条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00050","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5341,"end":5685,"target_id":"b71bb09bb161ef14cead50fa3e83a4481f8997323dddf0d973103cc12e8309b0","source_hash":"dcdbfab7631264e29096b4d0cda79a4c33027391034d0377e3f47f6b8ac1986a","text":"第七条（修改其他法律）①至<98> 已省略\n\n  <99> 韩国科学技术院学士学位条例部分修订如下。 \n\n  第十五条第一款“分别向科学技术部长和教育人力资源部长报告”应改为“向教育、科学和技术部长报告”。\n\n  第十五条第二款中的“应向科学技术部长和教育人力资源部长报告”应改为“应向教育、科学和技术部长报告”。\n\n  第十六条第一款第一项和第二款第三项中，“教育和人力资源部长”应全部改为“教育、科学和技术部长”；同一条第四款中，“科学技术部条例”应改为“教育、科学和技术部条例”。\n\n  <100> 至 <102> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00051","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5685,"end":5729,"target_id":"0583fa2e5828c7039655b5638a730c600b7f247b8b78f585648b9cabdc0d9031","source_hash":"56ee5b0d95f30044bc275784dea513b23a97e658b04e12abbad1470615c170de","text":"增补（大学教师资格标准等规定）<2012年2月29日第23644号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00052","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5729,"end":5814,"target_id":"00dc6e3d5227c50d2ce43bffa687b685cc65aa7255f4f22860cba85b74aa3acd","source_hash":"d1e753f438e8c8bc04fb4cf95f05e8a4db87021a1bb2b54db6673dcd7d129496","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。但是，……<省略>……附件第二条和第三条的修正规定自2012年7月22日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00053","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5814,"end":5822,"target_id":"094dc2e4c6d4f0347587c632d2753783166003ec20073ccd90a5e8d8457bcef5","source_hash":"1fa2d78222cc5f3a7b268ba3015a524a8e57a9355a8b17e0ae4253566ef34323","text":"第二条已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00054","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5822,"end":5990,"target_id":"92e98d21d876f147ad92790881a29b6de37d528f8700b60fc984a80d7fcf554c","source_hash":"f61822b8e6e1bae95eb747e6387eeef5b5e808b5d8a01e23dc0fe11bd42a92df","text":"第三条（修改其他法律）①至<62>款已省略\n\n  <63> 韩国科学技术院学士学位条例部分修订如下。\n\n  第五条第一款第一项中，“取得硕士学位且有两年以上研究经验或教学经验的高校全职讲师和助理教授”应改为“助理教授”。 \n\n  <64> 至 <69> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00055","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5990,"end":5998,"target_id":"b911de5de95bb1cfbbc8186e22ba64c34da14347f6ef2070efce82a26bfa17f7","source_hash":"bc28291f8a8368cab289540ec155c57b21b6d38387b73664ba08b936ee269006","text":"第四条已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00056","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5998,"end":6042,"target_id":"63e82e64a1b6197bb0f64b787466fce9b73ffe9da9403500195b48650e6aa58b","source_hash":"5ac3a09ca5ccc53d01c285de9a1ef0a2ba6acc4a2485aae9158e17029dfed2f5","text":"补充规定 <第24028号，2012年8月13日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00057","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":6042,"end":6086,"target_id":"074f87eda2471bf7ebd66669a1b5108e554daefcc6740d0494ea8e2f2217417b","source_hash":"706593abf008f4144d9f547ad88fc750f27c91d3fb254be952aa76e0a4e6879c","text":"补充规定 <第24472号，2013年3月23日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00058","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":6086,"end":6129,"target_id":"68080b6aec194a7f768ec685c6a18864c329252706fc3740021f60d410cd349e","source_hash":"a3c47358b5319a3ba45787da785dfea890df8d8d79398cc9047d30e04f9d9dac","text":"增编（政府行政和内政部及其附属机构的组织结构）<2014年11月19日，第25751号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00059","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":6129,"end":6254,"target_id":"a98342b8af231541d3b57857caaed59e3e3691f17a56eefbd050270eee9573c7","source_hash":"ecc5937743f918230a397055273a1cd44275217a8341699c9b3693e458eb6e4c","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。但是，根据补充法令第五条修正的总统令中，修正在本法令生效前已公布但生效日期尚未到来的总统令的部分，应自相关总统令各自的生效日期起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00060","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":6254,"end":6271,"target_id":"64b0fba5ba56cadc5c2eeb0068cb8fcc4bbea7abf714f98366b1312a4ec2a6bc","source_hash":"6ffda08faf109c176be482db4409396ced46b0373db22ad766c9b45cca3b755a","text":"省略第2至4条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00061","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":6271,"end":6427,"target_id":"041470abbc8604a0c8bb9fcf1af7a26053c559788c6b77dbec9282510a6f89d1","source_hash":"62b276ca4ea8a64fb8569c1af375f758873b722e6c3e3eb19b5566bff25c8100","text":"第五条（修改其他法律）①至<46>款已省略\n\n  <47> 韩国科学技术院学术规章部分修订如下。\n\n  第十五条第一款和第二款中的“科学、信息通信技术和未来规划部长和教育部长”应分别改为“教育部长和科学、信息通信技术和未来规划部长”。\n\n  <48> 至 <418> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00062","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":6427,"end":6473,"target_id":"142fe438f09aaf8e673f0361e755c276784257515bacf63f6468f35dcd1da03d","source_hash":"cfb44cd5f899ca3292ba74709f2052a65feaebc96397e13500759a0abd3a59ff","text":"增编（科学和信息通信技术部及其附属机构的组织结构）<2017年7月26日，第28210号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00063","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":6473,"end":6502,"target_id":"e73dc7072172848ff85e9858ef2d1306da0231dd85719ed36d643827c1232775","source_hash":"7e5f07ffff6aef2f2136019cfb5263979ba5a34dacd8394c05b2d3c719360d57","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00064","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":6502,"end":6519,"target_id":"c02ba49f0b748920750fc9ecf303e633ab0dde5e9fa270eab38db1428efabdec","source_hash":"90d7c234b09875f89ed9e65d48d7911823d8886f04f0ff283113cd913ec46436","text":"省略第2至5条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00065","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":6519,"end":6710,"target_id":"979c6f5596e4b07b4a7104558d0ba9421d850c6e8d4793a91b86fc04bf0ad29e","source_hash":"38fbbacfbfc246f15a28998d700f7acf6817b738c10b81a0243a68eb1f15ddb0","text":"第六条（修改其他法律）①至<65>款省略\n\n  <66> 韩国科学技术院学术规章部分修订如下。\n\n  第 15 条第 1 款和第 2 款中的“科学、信息通信技术和未来规划部长”应改为“科学和信息通信技术部长”。   \n\n  第十六条第四款“科学、信息通信技术和未来规划部条例”应改为“科学和信息通信技术部条例”。 \n\n  <67> 至 <70> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00066","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":6710,"end":6753,"target_id":"fb2dc06a09ef09bdcf6615b56faefab5f5a209ec93e993634b45b5211cb7895c","source_hash":"92baecb4b0d0d89bfa7799a474eef3ae0e0cca9f723a0d5cf9f744449484d4ec","text":"补充规定 <第34103号，2024年1月9日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00067","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":6753,"end":6799,"target_id":"f49fd3fdad6539ad771fb1bf5f9580d9afa2d6c814e904696d4bee0fbff3c427","source_hash":"4c42c9cec7b292ab021d1156dd227725f7ae4506f4afa864e21f4674ad39e670","text":"增编（科学技术信息通信部及其附属机构的组织结构）<第35801号，2025年10月1日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00068","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":6799,"end":6836,"target_id":"1979cf41f1594564727806092adbb8eff9f03b5a5caa248f4d158683799d0be9","source_hash":"7d7075d3fab665cdbaac560b14335b0ee552583c1a51db7e92e263494f72f34f","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00069","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":6836,"end":6844,"target_id":"5ecf6866798b0367ebae584dd26ee2982d2449374326c6679ee78a187f3f87a6","source_hash":"1fa2d78222cc5f3a7b268ba3015a524a8e57a9355a8b17e0ae4253566ef34323","text":"第二条已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00070","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005408-278245-ko","scope":"BODY","start":6844,"end":6982,"target_id":"1fcd0c81695055ce04fdb10c9aa186b349d91ffce49586fb09ee985dcf86183b","source_hash":"3b5399882b5f2f9673bd0224b7b11dea686e0b4545da65bff0b221e0e8fda7e7","text":"第三条（修改其他法律）①至<28>款省略\n\n  <29> 韩国科学技术院学术规章部分修改如下。 \n\n  第十五条第一款和第二款中的“教育部长和科学及信息通信技术部长”应分别改为“科学及信息通信技术部长和教育部长”。"}]}